			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:1.1%;">&nbsp;</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:11.6%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><i>Member</i></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr style="background-color: rgb(204, 238, 255);">
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:16%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Ann Cunningham, MBA</p>
			</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:1.1%;">&nbsp;</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:9.4%;">&nbsp;</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:1.1%;">&nbsp;</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:10.3%;">&nbsp;</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:1.1%;">&nbsp;</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:11.6%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><i>Member</i></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:16%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Margaret M. FitzPatrick, M.A.</p>
			</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:1.1%;">&nbsp;</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:9.4%;">&nbsp;</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:1.1%;">&nbsp;</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:10.3%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><i>Member</i></p>
			</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:1.1%;">&nbsp;</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:11.6%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><i>Member</i></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr style="background-color: rgb(204, 238, 255);">
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:16%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Jerry B. Gin, Ph.D.</p>
			</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:1.1%;">&nbsp;</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:9.4%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><i>Member</i></p>
			</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:1.1%;">&nbsp;</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:10.3%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><i>Chair</i></p>
			</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:1.1%;">&nbsp;</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:11.6%;">&nbsp;</td>
		</tr>
		<tr style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:16%;">Mary L. Rotunno, J.D.</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:1.1%;">&nbsp;</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:9.4%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><i>Member</i></p>
			</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:1.1%;">&nbsp;</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:10.3%;">&nbsp;</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:1.1%;">&nbsp;</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:11.6%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><i>Chair</i></p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</table>

<p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;text-indent:36pt;">Members serve on these committees until their resignation or until otherwise determined by our Board.</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&nbsp;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><i>Audit Committee</i></p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&nbsp;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;text-indent:36pt;">During our fiscal year ended March 31, 2023, the Audit Committee of our Board consisted of Mr. Saxe, who serves as the committee chairperson, Dr. Gin and Ms. Rotunno. Mr. Saxe is our Audit Committee financial expert, as that term is defined under SEC rules implementing Section 407 of the Sarbanes Oxley Act of 2002, and possesses the requisite financial sophistication, as defined under applicable rules. The Audit Committee operates under a written charter. Our Audit Committee charter is available on our website at <u>www.vistagen.com</u>. Under its charter, our Audit Committee is primarily responsible for, among other things, the following:</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&nbsp;</p>

<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; text-indent: 0px;">

		<tr style="vertical-align: top;">
			<td style="width: 36pt;">&nbsp;</td>
			<td style="width: 18pt;">
			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#9679;</p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: auto;">
			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">overseeing our accounting and financial reporting process;</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</table>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&nbsp;</p>

<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; text-indent: 0px;">

		<tr style="vertical-align: top;">
			<td style="width: 36pt;">&nbsp;</td>
			<td style="width: 18pt;">
			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#9679;</p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: auto;">
			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">selecting, retaining and replacing our independent auditors and evaluating their qualifications, independence and performance;</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</table>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&nbsp;</p>

<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; text-indent: 0px;">

		<tr style="vertical-align: top;">
			<td style="width: 36pt;">&nbsp;</td>
			<td style="width: 18pt;">
			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#9679;</p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: auto;">
			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">reviewing and approving scope of the annual audit and audit fees;</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</table>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&nbsp;</p>

<div class="PGBK" style="width: 100%; margin-left: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt">
<div class="PGFTR" style="text-align: center; width: 100%">
<div class="hf-row">
<div class="hf-cell PGNUM" data-number="13" data-prefix="" data-suffix="" style="text-align: center; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Times New Roman;">13</div>
</div>
</div>

