		<tr style="vertical-align: top;">
			<td style="width: 36pt;">
			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><sup style="vertical-align:top;line-height:120%;">(1)</sup></p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: auto;">
			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Represents an option to purchase shares of our common stock at $41.10 per share granted on March 1, 2022 when the market price of our common stock was $41.10 per share.&nbsp;&nbsp;The option became exercisable for 25% of the shares granted immediately upon grant, with the remaining shares becoming exercisable ratably monthly through March 1, 2024, when all shares granted will be fully exercisable.</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</table>

<p style="margin: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&nbsp;</p>

<div class="PGBK" style="width: 100%; margin-left: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt">
