			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Includes 667 shares of common stock held by Dr. Gin's wife. Also includes options to purchase 214,562 shares of registered common stock exercisable within 60 days of July 28, 2023.</p>
